      "text": "Buenos Aires, often called the Paris of Latin America, pairs elegant boulevards with a Latin flair. Patagonia is one of the world’s last great wildernesses, from the vast Perito Moreno Glacier to the lakes and peaks of Torres del Paine. And the jewel in the Bolivian crown, the Salar de Uyuni, stretches white to the horizon; in the rainy season it mirrors the sky.",
